WEBVTT

01:30.240 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:56.800 --> 01:57.840
What are you staring at?

01:59.960 --> 02:01.360
This Princess Qingyang

02:01.960 --> 02:04.840
is a gift from the defeated Xilin Kingdom
to the Saint Emperor.

02:07.440 --> 02:08.720
A noble princess

02:09.440 --> 02:10.759
can be treated as a gift?

02:11.840 --> 02:12.840
In times of chaos,

02:13.880 --> 02:15.280
what value does a princess hold?

02:17.440 --> 02:18.400
Mr. He Zhou has arrived!

02:18.480 --> 02:19.480
-Move!
-Go!

02:19.560 --> 02:20.520
You spy!

02:20.600 --> 02:21.880
How dare you steal the march plans?

02:21.960 --> 02:22.920
Move!

02:23.000 --> 02:23.880
Your Majesty!

02:27.600 --> 02:28.720
Your Majesty,

02:28.800 --> 02:31.000
we caught this spy in the camp
while he was trying to escape.

02:31.080 --> 02:32.840
He had our return march plans
hidden on him.

02:33.760 --> 02:35.080
He must be a remnant of the rebels,

02:35.160 --> 02:36.600
trying to hinder our return to the city.

02:39.600 --> 02:41.400
RETURN MARCH PLANS

02:43.240 --> 02:44.600
What were you planning

02:44.680 --> 02:45.840
by stealing the march plans?

02:45.920 --> 02:46.840
Speak!

02:55.560 --> 02:56.760
He's dead.

02:56.840 --> 02:58.640
He had poison hidden in his mouth
and took his own life.

02:59.600 --> 03:01.840
Your Majesty,
he was determined to face death.

03:02.680 --> 03:04.160
Luckily, we caught him during patrol.

03:04.240 --> 03:05.280
Otherwise,

03:05.360 --> 03:07.920
if the march plans were stolen,
our return would have been delayed.

03:08.520 --> 03:10.520
But now the spy is dead,

03:10.600 --> 03:11.480
and we have no way

03:12.520 --> 03:13.640
to confirm what they were planning.

03:16.240 --> 03:17.760
At least the march plans are intact.

03:18.920 --> 03:19.840
Issue my command.

03:19.920 --> 03:22.600
Guard the march plans strictly tonight,
and we'll return swiftly tomorrow!

03:23.160 --> 03:24.080
Understood.

03:43.720 --> 03:45.480
-Your Majesty are wise!
-Step back!

03:45.560 --> 03:47.080
-You've brought peace to the land!
-You all…

03:47.880 --> 03:49.200
Step back!

03:49.280 --> 03:50.360
Step back!

03:53.240 --> 03:54.120
Step back!

03:54.200 --> 03:55.360
His Majesty has arrived!

03:55.440 --> 03:56.960
Make way!

03:57.560 --> 04:00.040
You've brought peace to the land!

04:00.120 --> 04:03.200
Your Majesty are wise!
You've brought peace to the land!

04:03.280 --> 04:05.000
Your Majesty are wise!
You've brought peace to the land!

04:05.080 --> 04:06.520
Your Majesty are wise!
You've brought peace to the land!

04:06.600 --> 04:07.640
Your Majesty!

04:07.720 --> 04:09.600
I heard the Princess Qingyang from Xilin
came along with the army.

04:09.680 --> 04:10.880
Is that her?

04:10.960 --> 04:12.000
The Xilin princess coming to Dongze

04:12.080 --> 04:13.440
is a sign of alliance
between the two nations, right?

04:14.040 --> 04:14.920
-She's so beautiful!
-That's wonderful!

04:15.000 --> 04:16.040
The princess is so stunning!

04:16.120 --> 04:16.959
-Exactly!
-She and His Majesty

04:17.040 --> 04:18.720
are a perfect match!

04:18.800 --> 04:20.279
Exactly!

04:20.360 --> 04:21.320
Don't you agree?

04:22.200 --> 04:23.440
She's so gorgeous, right?

04:24.200 --> 04:28.040
-Your Majesty are wise!
-Your Majesty are wise!

04:29.720 --> 04:33.880
GRACEFUL PALACE

04:35.640 --> 04:37.200
His Majesty actually
gave the Everjoy Palace,

04:37.280 --> 04:38.160
the closest to the Everbright Palace,

04:38.240 --> 04:39.880
to Princess Qingyang.

04:39.960 --> 04:42.800
It seems she's about to become
the leading lady of the palace soon.

04:42.880 --> 04:45.440
I thought Miss Pearl
would marry His Majesty.

04:46.680 --> 04:49.640
What do you think, if His Majesty
marries Princess Qingyang,

04:49.720 --> 04:51.520
what will happen to Miss Pearl?

04:51.600 --> 04:53.320
Will she be titled
as a concubine by His Majesty,

04:53.400 --> 04:56.120
or will Princess Qingyang
see her as a threat and drive her away?

04:57.440 --> 04:59.680
Someone who can help
Zhao Ming stabilize the chaos

04:59.760 --> 05:01.960
and can fight against
the Divine Clan with him

05:02.040 --> 05:03.600
is his true companion, right?

05:04.560 --> 05:06.440
If I can't help Zhao Ming,

05:06.520 --> 05:08.840
then to him, what am I?

05:12.120 --> 05:13.120
Your Majesty,

05:13.200 --> 05:14.960
Princess Qingyang
has moved into the Everjoy Palace.

05:15.480 --> 05:16.760
What are your plans next?

05:17.960 --> 05:19.360
Wait a while longer.

05:20.000 --> 05:22.240
Once the spies from Xilin
make contact with those inside the palace,

05:22.320 --> 05:23.720
we'll devise a plan to send her away.

05:24.320 --> 05:26.080
Since you've identified the spies,

05:26.600 --> 05:27.920
why not eliminate them entirely?

05:29.160 --> 05:30.680
Known spies

05:31.560 --> 05:33.240
are more valuable than having none at all.

05:34.480 --> 05:35.480
We can use them

05:35.560 --> 05:36.760
to pass along the messages
we want to send.

05:40.200 --> 05:41.480
Your Majesty, please rest early.

05:46.880 --> 05:48.880
Your Majesty, Princess Qingyang
requests an audience.

05:50.000 --> 05:52.600
Princess, coming here late at night,
is there something urgent?

05:52.680 --> 05:53.520
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

05:53.600 --> 05:55.560
What I told you before

05:55.640 --> 05:57.280
was spoken from the heart.

05:57.920 --> 05:59.880
I know you intend
to oppose the Divine Clan.

06:00.680 --> 06:03.040
I'm willing to assist you.

06:04.440 --> 06:06.440
To reach the Divine Realm,

06:06.520 --> 06:08.160
one must ascend the Celestial Ladder.

06:08.880 --> 06:10.400
However, without the deities' permission,

06:11.080 --> 06:12.920
if a mortal attempts

06:13.000 --> 06:14.920
to climb,

06:15.000 --> 06:17.080
they will suffer
the Divine Fire Punishment.

06:18.440 --> 06:21.160
A mortal's body
cannot endure it for a moment.

06:22.160 --> 06:24.800
Even though you were born
with divine channels,

06:24.880 --> 06:27.560
I'm afraid you'd only make it halfway.

06:28.720 --> 06:30.720
I was fortunate enough
to obtain a rare treasure.

06:31.280 --> 06:32.560
After much study,

06:33.160 --> 06:35.120
I discovered it's a fragment
from the year of Cang Hao,

06:35.200 --> 06:37.080
when the Celestial Ladder was damaged.

06:37.160 --> 06:39.000
It fell to the mortal realm.

06:40.040 --> 06:41.520
I can help you

06:41.600 --> 06:43.720
adapt to the pain of the Celestial Ladder

06:43.800 --> 06:46.080
and find a way to ascend.

06:46.160 --> 06:47.520
Why should we trust you?

06:48.160 --> 06:50.880
Your Majesty have studied ways
to oppose the Divine Clan for years.

06:51.840 --> 06:53.160
You'll judge the truth.

07:07.320 --> 07:08.760
Your Majesty,
I'll summon the imperial physician.

07:08.840 --> 07:09.920
No need.

07:15.680 --> 07:16.520
What do you want?

07:17.120 --> 07:20.040
What I want
is to stay in the Dongze Palace.

07:20.840 --> 07:22.880
My father sent me here,

07:22.960 --> 07:25.360
hoping I'd join the harem of Dongze.

07:25.960 --> 07:28.120
If I fail this mission,

07:29.240 --> 07:31.880
he'll kill both me and my mother.

07:32.560 --> 07:34.440
His Majesty can bring your mother
to Dongze as well

07:35.280 --> 07:36.360
and help you both escape.

07:36.960 --> 07:39.000
If it were that easy to leave,

07:40.720 --> 07:42.080
would I have waited until now?

07:45.400 --> 07:46.480
Your Majesty,

07:47.440 --> 07:49.240
my father is controlled by an evil deity.

07:49.320 --> 07:51.640
He seeks immortality

07:51.720 --> 07:52.800
and helps the evil deity refine poison.

07:52.880 --> 07:55.280
Since childhood, I've been
used by him to test medicines

07:55.360 --> 07:56.320
and poisons.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.400
To control me better,

07:58.480 --> 08:00.600
he poisoned my mother.

08:00.680 --> 08:01.840
Only the evil deity holds the antidote.

08:02.720 --> 08:04.200
If we run away,

08:04.280 --> 08:05.360
there will be no cure for her.

08:06.560 --> 08:08.160
I hope Your Majesty will marry me,

08:08.760 --> 08:10.840
or at least pretend to.

08:11.600 --> 08:13.400
This way, you can deceive my father

08:13.480 --> 08:14.840
and the evil deity behind him.

08:52.720 --> 08:54.400
The emotional veins grow,

08:55.360 --> 08:56.760
bringing piercing pain.

08:58.240 --> 08:59.800
It's Hao Tian's punishment

08:59.880 --> 09:01.000
for artifacts that fall in love.

09:03.280 --> 09:06.120
When the veins spread
from the heart to the fingertips,

09:06.640 --> 09:08.200
the heavens will deliver their wrath.

09:10.240 --> 09:12.720
It will mark the beginning of their doom.

09:14.920 --> 09:16.040
Emotional veins…

09:17.320 --> 09:18.440
The name

09:19.360 --> 09:20.640
is rather poetic.

09:21.400 --> 09:24.080
You must return
to the Celestial Altar with me immediately

09:24.160 --> 09:26.600
to completely rid yourself
of the pain from the emotional veins.

09:42.320 --> 09:43.320
Fate,

09:44.600 --> 09:46.000
I think I now

09:46.080 --> 09:47.720
understand the taste of love.

09:48.960 --> 09:50.360
It's not only sweet.

09:50.880 --> 09:52.280
There's also bitterness and sorrow.

09:54.360 --> 09:55.480
I don't want to return
to the Celestial Altar.

09:57.480 --> 09:59.680
I want to experience
being a person with emotions.

10:00.320 --> 10:02.920
For this so-called love,

10:04.760 --> 10:06.440
you would rather die?

10:07.120 --> 10:08.400
Isn't death

10:09.240 --> 10:10.400
the fate of all humans?

10:23.480 --> 10:24.960
But you're an ancient artifact.

10:25.880 --> 10:28.360
You surpass both humans and deities!

10:28.440 --> 10:29.320
Is death…

10:33.640 --> 10:34.880
really worth it?

10:37.000 --> 10:38.720
I don't know if it's worth it,

10:39.640 --> 10:40.760
but right now,

10:41.600 --> 10:42.960
this is my choice.

10:52.000 --> 10:53.480
Who would've thought

10:54.080 --> 10:56.440
Zhao Ming could stabilize all the regions
in such a short time?

10:58.520 --> 11:00.240
These small nations are truly useless!

11:01.040 --> 11:03.760
If my divine power
weren't limited in the human realm,

11:03.840 --> 11:05.960
I'd have dragged him
to the Celestial Realm

11:06.040 --> 11:08.000
and fought him myself.

11:08.600 --> 11:10.760
Then let's use the human way
to deal with him.

11:11.400 --> 11:13.360
Even heroes fall for beauty.

11:14.160 --> 11:16.520
Qingyang has successfully
entered the palace.

11:18.160 --> 11:20.800
So many emperors
have been ruined by women!

11:20.880 --> 11:22.840
As long as Qingyang
can cause chaos in Dongze,

11:23.440 --> 11:25.720
Zhao Ming's sovereign fortune
will come to an end.

11:26.880 --> 11:30.480
By then, what will he have left
to resist the Divine Clan?

11:31.040 --> 11:32.200
In the end,

11:32.280 --> 11:34.880
submission will be his only option.

11:47.000 --> 11:48.520
Mr. Fate!

11:56.440 --> 11:58.280
The Book of Fate
has been silent for years,

11:58.360 --> 11:59.200
answering no questions.

11:59.800 --> 12:02.360
Who would've thought
you had come to the human realm?

12:03.640 --> 12:05.680
Have you left the Celestial Altar

12:05.760 --> 12:07.520
on Hao Tian's orders?

12:09.880 --> 12:11.400
Then, whose command
were you three following

12:12.280 --> 12:13.440
to descend to the human realm?

12:16.040 --> 12:17.160
Sir, don't be angry.

12:17.800 --> 12:20.000
The Divine Clan has no intention
of breaking Hao Tian's rules.

12:20.600 --> 12:21.640
We are here

12:21.720 --> 12:24.440
only because of the Book of Fate's
instruction that day.

12:24.520 --> 12:25.760
Sir, do you still recall

12:25.840 --> 12:27.360
the prophecy of the Divine Child's birth

12:27.440 --> 12:28.920
and the ruin of the deities?

12:29.800 --> 12:30.720
Indeed.

12:30.800 --> 12:32.840
We humbly ask you to reveal the truth,

12:32.920 --> 12:34.040
so we can locate the Divine Child.

12:36.440 --> 12:38.520
So, Jun Yu's afraid of it.

12:39.560 --> 12:41.440
The Immortal Emperor
is merely acting for the Divine Clan.

12:42.040 --> 12:43.200
In my eyes,

12:43.280 --> 12:45.000
there is no difference

12:45.080 --> 12:47.600
between the Divine Clan, the Human Clan,

12:47.680 --> 12:48.560
or the Spirit Clan.

12:49.320 --> 12:50.960
Even if I know
the whereabouts of the Divine Child,

12:51.800 --> 12:53.040
why should I tell you?

12:56.360 --> 12:58.600
You see through our actions.

12:58.680 --> 13:00.280
You could've remained unseen.

13:00.360 --> 13:02.000
Now that you've revealed yourself,

13:03.000 --> 13:04.560
is there something you wish to say?

13:08.760 --> 13:10.680
You want to deal with Zhao Ming,

13:11.640 --> 13:13.360
but this fire of chaos

13:14.000 --> 13:15.680
isn't burning hot enough,

13:16.560 --> 13:17.600
nor fierce enough.

13:18.280 --> 13:20.000
So, you suggest…

13:20.080 --> 13:22.680
Keeping Zhao Ming
distracted with national affairs,

13:24.960 --> 13:25.960
or even…

13:28.680 --> 13:29.640
removing him altogether.

13:35.760 --> 13:37.200
Your Majesty, are you ready?

13:37.960 --> 13:39.000
Let's begin.

13:58.080 --> 14:00.280
The divine fire doesn't burn
clothes or flesh.

14:00.360 --> 14:03.080
Instead, it delivers pain
that pierces the soul.

14:03.840 --> 14:06.000
If Your Majesty can endure it this time,

14:06.800 --> 14:08.320
you'll gradually adapt in the future.

14:35.640 --> 14:36.640
He Zhou!

14:37.600 --> 14:38.200
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

14:38.280 --> 14:40.480
Why are you here? Go back quickly!

14:41.960 --> 14:42.880
Is Zhao Ming inside?

14:43.880 --> 14:45.040
No, he's not.

14:45.760 --> 14:46.760
By the way,

14:46.840 --> 14:49.360
have you felt anything unusual?

14:49.960 --> 14:52.400
Like, a burning pain?

14:53.080 --> 14:54.560
No. What's wrong?

14:56.320 --> 14:57.800
His Majesty's dealing
with important matters today

14:57.880 --> 14:59.360
and cannot see you for the time being.

15:00.000 --> 15:01.800
What's happened again?

15:02.320 --> 15:04.320
He Zhou, don't try to fool me this time.

15:05.040 --> 15:06.080
No, nothing.

15:06.880 --> 15:07.920
Zhao…

15:23.480 --> 15:25.680
He Zhou, His Majesty is resting.

15:25.760 --> 15:27.440
No one is allowed to disturb him.

15:39.720 --> 15:40.760
He Zhou,

15:43.160 --> 15:44.960
does this important matter

15:45.040 --> 15:46.560
have to do with Princess Qingyang?

15:49.080 --> 15:50.880
You should go back.
I'll explain it to you later.

15:51.680 --> 15:52.640
I…

15:52.720 --> 15:54.240
His Majesty is truly exhausted.

15:54.320 --> 15:55.520
Let's not disturb him.

15:59.160 --> 16:00.280
Alright.

16:01.120 --> 16:02.440
I'll come back another day.

16:20.520 --> 16:21.360
He Zhou.

16:24.640 --> 16:26.480
Your Majesty, you're awake!
How is your health?

16:27.240 --> 16:28.280
It's nothing serious.

16:35.160 --> 16:36.480
The Celestial Ladder's divine fire

16:37.560 --> 16:38.920
is indeed extraordinary.

16:43.120 --> 16:44.240
Did Pearl come by?

16:45.160 --> 16:47.760
-I faintly heard her voice.
-Yes,

16:47.840 --> 16:49.520
as per your instructions,

16:49.600 --> 16:50.640
I didn't let her in.

16:52.520 --> 16:53.680
That's good.

16:55.160 --> 16:57.160
You hide these things from Pearl

16:57.240 --> 16:58.360
and keep her away

16:58.960 --> 17:01.000
because you fear that the fragment
of your essence within her

17:01.080 --> 17:02.880
would share the pain of the divine fire?
Or is it because

17:02.960 --> 17:05.359
you don't want her to worry
about your injuries and weakness?

17:07.920 --> 17:09.240
Perhaps both.

17:10.480 --> 17:11.319
I…

17:16.960 --> 17:18.520
Just say what you intend to.

17:19.440 --> 17:20.760
There are rumors spreading in the palace

17:20.839 --> 17:22.800
that Princess Qingyang
will marry Your Majesty.

17:22.880 --> 17:25.640
With Princess Qingyang
frequenting Everbright Palace,

17:25.720 --> 17:27.480
the spies from Xilin believe it's true.

17:27.560 --> 17:30.000
Before long, they'll relay
the news back to Xilin.

17:30.080 --> 17:32.120
For now, Princess Qingyang's crisis
is resolved.

17:33.000 --> 17:34.160
However,

17:34.240 --> 17:36.160
if you don't tell Pearl the truth,

17:36.240 --> 17:37.680
she might be heartbroken.

17:40.280 --> 17:41.520
You know Pearl's nature

17:42.240 --> 17:43.440
as well as I do.

17:44.640 --> 17:46.080
If she knew what I was doing,

17:46.680 --> 17:48.840
she would go to any lengths to help me.

17:51.200 --> 17:53.160
The fight against the Divine Clan
leads only to death or injury.

17:54.240 --> 17:56.320
Even knowing she is the Chaos Pearl,

17:56.400 --> 17:57.560
I don't want to use her.

18:00.480 --> 18:02.080
Let Pearl remain just her own Pearl,

18:03.040 --> 18:04.600
not Zhao Ming's Pearl.

18:11.400 --> 18:12.840
Greetings, Miss Pearl.

18:38.480 --> 18:43.720
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

19:15.240 --> 19:16.280
He Zhou!

19:17.720 --> 19:18.960
Keep moving.

19:48.120 --> 19:49.640
EVERJOY PALACE

19:49.720 --> 19:51.240
-You go.
-No, you go.

19:51.320 --> 19:52.720
-You should go.
-What's wrong?

19:54.280 --> 19:55.480
Miss Pearl,

19:55.560 --> 19:57.000
we're here to deliver pastries
to Princess Qingyang.

19:57.600 --> 19:58.520
Why aren't you going in?

19:59.200 --> 20:00.480
Because…

20:01.160 --> 20:02.560
Because…

20:02.640 --> 20:04.280
Yesterday, a maid
came to deliver something

20:04.360 --> 20:05.960
and was scolded to tears by the princess.

20:06.040 --> 20:08.400
Now, we're… too scared to go in.

20:11.360 --> 20:12.400
I'll go.

20:13.280 --> 20:14.520
Thank you, Miss Pearl!

21:09.800 --> 21:11.120
What brings you here?

21:13.440 --> 21:16.360
I heard you scolded
a maid to tears yesterday.

21:16.920 --> 21:18.760
Now they're all afraid of you

21:18.840 --> 21:19.920
and don't dare come in.

21:20.000 --> 21:22.960
So, I came to deliver pastries for them.

21:23.760 --> 21:26.280
How overly sensitive. They made mistakes

21:26.880 --> 21:27.880
and couldn't even handle a scolding?

21:28.600 --> 21:30.800
From now on,
they don't need to come anymore.

21:34.240 --> 21:35.760
But you're a princess.

21:35.840 --> 21:37.360
If no one takes care of you,

21:37.440 --> 21:38.640
won't that be inconvenient?

21:40.800 --> 21:42.560
Does being a princess mean

21:42.640 --> 21:44.880
I must've been spoiled and pampered?

21:52.720 --> 21:54.160
Have you gotten used

21:54.240 --> 21:55.600
to living here these days?

21:58.560 --> 22:00.920
If I said I haven't,

22:01.440 --> 22:03.720
are you planning to send me back to Xilin?

22:03.800 --> 22:06.520
You don't need to be
so defensive around me.

22:06.600 --> 22:08.200
I've never thought of being your enemy.

22:08.280 --> 22:09.840
Even if I take His Majesty away?

22:17.680 --> 22:19.320
I know you love him.

22:19.400 --> 22:21.520
But you've probably heard,

22:21.600 --> 22:24.640
soon, I'll be marrying him.

22:25.400 --> 22:27.520
Coming to me won't help.

22:27.600 --> 22:29.520
You should go cry
in the Everbright Palace.

22:31.080 --> 22:34.000
Zhao Ming was never mine to begin with.

22:35.360 --> 22:36.760
There's no taking involved.

22:38.160 --> 22:39.760
I'm just curious…

22:41.160 --> 22:43.480
You've never met Zhao Ming before,

22:43.560 --> 22:45.200
yet you want to marry him.

22:45.280 --> 22:46.680
Is it really because you love him?

22:49.480 --> 22:50.640
No, I don't love him.

22:52.400 --> 22:53.640
But I have to marry him.

22:53.720 --> 22:55.680
Marrying someone you don't love,

22:56.240 --> 22:57.640
isn't that too careless?

22:57.720 --> 22:59.680
And marrying someone
just because you love them,

23:00.520 --> 23:02.120
isn't that too simple?

23:10.200 --> 23:11.120
Look outside.

23:12.840 --> 23:16.000
In the palace of Xilin,
we have such beautiful ponds too.

23:17.280 --> 23:18.440
And…

23:18.520 --> 23:20.080
blooming peach trees like these

23:20.720 --> 23:22.480
and elegant pavilions.

23:23.800 --> 23:26.040
Do you know what I think

23:27.120 --> 23:28.720
every time I see such beauty?

23:31.560 --> 23:32.960
I think…

23:33.880 --> 23:34.960
It's so beautiful.

23:36.440 --> 23:38.160
Where would be a good place for me to die?

23:50.320 --> 23:51.480
So, you see,

23:52.000 --> 23:55.600
people can never
truly understand each other.

23:57.720 --> 23:59.520
Keep your curiosity to yourself.

24:01.120 --> 24:02.720
You've been so well-protected.

24:04.480 --> 24:06.200
You'll never understand me.

24:06.280 --> 24:07.680
But you're still alive.

24:08.640 --> 24:10.000
Doesn't that mean

24:11.120 --> 24:14.040
there's still something
you care about, some hope in your heart?

24:19.120 --> 24:22.360
So, live well.

24:23.680 --> 24:25.760
What if one day your hopes come true?

24:30.520 --> 24:33.200
I've delivered the pastries.

24:34.480 --> 24:35.320
I'll take my leave now.

25:01.480 --> 25:03.520
-Miss Pearl.
-Yan.

25:07.600 --> 25:10.120
Don't come here again.
Stay as far away from her as possible.

25:10.200 --> 25:11.400
Why?

25:13.840 --> 25:14.840
She's not a good person.

25:15.720 --> 25:16.920
Not a good person?

25:17.960 --> 25:19.080
Why would you say that?

25:20.800 --> 25:21.920
The more beautiful a woman is,

25:22.960 --> 25:24.240
the more ruthless her heart.

25:25.720 --> 25:27.240
What kind of nonsense is that?

25:29.520 --> 25:30.360
What about me then?

25:31.320 --> 25:32.440
You're different.

25:32.960 --> 25:34.280
You don't have a heart.

25:34.360 --> 25:35.440
You're just a little naive.

25:39.680 --> 25:41.000
Yan,

25:41.080 --> 25:43.720
do you have some history with Qingyang?

25:46.200 --> 25:47.280
No.

25:48.240 --> 25:49.600
I've said all I need to say.

25:50.440 --> 25:51.560
Believe it or not, that's up to you.

25:52.920 --> 25:54.120
What about Zhao Ming?

25:54.640 --> 25:56.280
Is he still busy?

25:56.360 --> 25:57.600
His Majesty is tied up
with official matters.

25:57.680 --> 25:58.680
He won't be available for these days.

25:58.760 --> 26:00.560
-Then…
-Also for the next few days.

26:05.560 --> 26:06.600
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

26:06.680 --> 26:07.960
Sir, why do you suddenly want to leave?

26:08.640 --> 26:10.680
Dongze no longer accepts divine edicts.

26:10.760 --> 26:11.840
Why would you still need an advisor?

26:11.920 --> 26:14.040
Dongze needs you,

26:14.120 --> 26:15.800
not for the divine edicts,

26:15.880 --> 26:17.480
but for your abilities.

26:18.400 --> 26:20.880
You understand the heavens and the earth,
and you see into the human heart.

26:20.960 --> 26:22.200
No one in this world compares to you.

26:22.800 --> 26:24.600
At the wrong time,

26:25.120 --> 26:27.680
in the wrong place, such abilities

26:28.880 --> 26:30.000
are meaningless.

26:30.720 --> 26:32.320
Sir, have you truly decided to leave?

26:32.400 --> 26:34.120
Your Majesty once said

26:34.200 --> 26:36.480
my comings and goings are mine to decide.

26:44.680 --> 26:46.120
After ten years together,

26:47.520 --> 26:48.960
would you grant me

26:49.480 --> 26:51.120
one last game of chess?

26:57.880 --> 26:59.040
This game of chess

27:00.560 --> 27:02.040
seems endless.

27:03.760 --> 27:05.920
Who would've thought
it would lead to such a situation?

27:06.720 --> 27:08.240
The game cycles over and over,

27:08.960 --> 27:11.240
with no outcome, no victor.

27:11.320 --> 27:13.640
Is this your way of making me stay?

27:14.920 --> 27:16.560
If it could keep you here,

27:17.520 --> 27:18.560
then it wouldn't be so bad.

27:21.080 --> 27:22.480
My staying

27:22.560 --> 27:24.120
might not be a good thing

27:24.200 --> 27:25.400
for Your Majesty.

27:28.240 --> 27:29.440
You should know,

27:30.520 --> 27:31.680
I only believe
that effort determines outcomes.

27:31.760 --> 27:33.920
I also know Your Majesty believe even more

27:34.680 --> 27:36.360
that humanity
can triumph over the heavens.

27:38.320 --> 27:40.760
Perhaps, someday not far from now,

27:41.360 --> 27:43.000
we will meet again

27:43.080 --> 27:44.560
elsewhere,

27:44.640 --> 27:46.760
and you will have fulfilled
your wish to resist the Divine Clan.

27:50.720 --> 27:52.560
It seems I cannot keep you today.

27:54.600 --> 27:55.840
As we part,

27:56.880 --> 27:58.000
I wish you

27:58.800 --> 28:00.200
a journey free of chains

28:01.040 --> 28:02.160
and actions

28:02.960 --> 28:04.200
guided by your heart.

28:06.280 --> 28:07.400
Guided by the heart…

28:11.480 --> 28:13.440
Then I'll accept
Your Majesty's kind words.

28:17.600 --> 28:21.360
XILIN KINGDOM

28:27.800 --> 28:28.840
Eat it.

28:29.440 --> 28:30.440
This is this month's antidote.

28:31.280 --> 28:34.240
Your precious daughter
is making good progress on her mission.

28:35.560 --> 28:36.920
Qingyang…

28:37.000 --> 28:38.120
How is Qingyang?

28:38.200 --> 28:41.560
According to our spies,
she's quite favored by Zhao Ming.

28:42.720 --> 28:43.760
She's thriving

28:43.840 --> 28:45.680
in the Everbright Palace.

28:46.280 --> 28:47.640
She's probably already forgotten

28:48.160 --> 28:49.920
that her mother is still here.

28:53.240 --> 28:54.440
This might be for the best.

28:55.480 --> 28:57.040
I hope she never comes back.

28:57.120 --> 28:58.240
If she wants to escape me,

28:59.000 --> 29:00.400
that's impossible!

29:00.480 --> 29:02.360
I am her father!

29:03.360 --> 29:04.640
What right do you have?

29:05.240 --> 29:07.400
You exploit your daughter
and hurt your daughter.

29:07.480 --> 29:08.480
You use her as a living test subject,

29:08.560 --> 29:10.080
as a tool, as a bargaining chip

29:10.160 --> 29:11.600
to achieve your filthy goals!

29:16.400 --> 29:18.120
She is the princess of Xilin Kingdom.

29:18.200 --> 29:20.480
She should dedicate everything she has

29:20.560 --> 29:22.600
to the immortality
and prosperity of Xilin!

29:23.600 --> 29:24.760
To Xilin Kingdom,

29:25.360 --> 29:28.320
or rather, to your selfish delusion
of immortality, right?

29:28.920 --> 29:30.760
I am the King of Xilin!

29:30.840 --> 29:32.080
Xilin Kingdom is me,

29:32.160 --> 29:34.320
and I am Xilin Kingdom!

29:36.640 --> 29:37.680
Your Excellency,

29:37.760 --> 29:39.560
according to the spy's report,

29:39.640 --> 29:42.840
Qingyang is highly favored by Zhao Ming.

29:42.920 --> 29:44.200
It seems they'll be getting married soon.

29:45.360 --> 29:46.320
Useless!

29:46.400 --> 29:48.760
Who cares about
these romantic developments?

29:48.840 --> 29:50.200
Why hasn't Qingyang made her move yet?

29:50.800 --> 29:52.920
Perhaps she hasn't found

29:53.000 --> 29:54.760
the perfect opportunity to strike.

29:55.960 --> 29:57.440
The perfect opportunity?

29:59.360 --> 30:00.440
Could it be

30:00.520 --> 30:02.080
that your daughter's fallen for Zhao Ming,

30:02.160 --> 30:03.040
trapped by love?

30:03.120 --> 30:04.440
Impossible!

30:04.960 --> 30:06.920
Her mother is still in my hands.

30:07.000 --> 30:09.520
You're bound by the Mother-Child Poison.

30:09.600 --> 30:11.360
Neither can live without the other.

30:11.440 --> 30:13.240
If you die,

30:13.320 --> 30:15.200
then your precious daughter

30:15.280 --> 30:16.720
won't survive either.

30:19.680 --> 30:22.320
Moreover, Qingyang herself is poisoned.

30:22.400 --> 30:24.160
She depends on my medicine
each month to survive.

30:24.240 --> 30:26.840
I'll write a letter immediately
to push her to act quickly.

30:28.080 --> 30:29.160
Or better yet,

30:29.240 --> 30:30.600
why don't you go to Dongze yourself

30:31.280 --> 30:32.600
and oversee her completing the mission?

30:32.680 --> 30:34.880
If she continues to delay,

30:35.480 --> 30:38.760
find an opportunity
and handle it personally.

30:40.760 --> 30:41.840
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

30:41.920 --> 30:42.800
The Xilin King has sent a letter,

30:43.640 --> 30:45.160
saying he greatly misses his daughter

30:46.400 --> 30:48.480
and wishes to come here
to celebrate her birthday.

30:48.560 --> 30:50.760
The Xilin King
never favored this daughter.

30:51.840 --> 30:52.960
His intentions

30:53.840 --> 30:54.840
must be suspicious.

30:56.240 --> 30:58.040
An unusual act must hide secret motives.

30:58.120 --> 30:59.720
Your Majesty, we should refuse.

30:59.800 --> 31:00.720
No.

31:01.960 --> 31:03.320
-Let him come.
-Your Majesty…

31:03.400 --> 31:05.000
He's a piece of the puzzle.

31:06.160 --> 31:07.360
If he doesn't come,

31:07.880 --> 31:09.280
I would have invited him myself.

31:09.360 --> 31:10.400
But your health…

31:10.480 --> 31:11.480
It's fine.

31:13.760 --> 31:14.760
I've gradually mastered

31:14.840 --> 31:16.280
controlling the divine fire
of the Celestial Ladder.

31:17.400 --> 31:18.560
I can handle it.

31:19.080 --> 31:20.120
Congrats, Your Majesty!

31:21.720 --> 31:23.960
Now, you no longer
need to keep this from Pearl.

31:27.000 --> 31:27.880
How has Pearl been lately?

31:28.560 --> 31:30.960
She knows you're busy,
so she hasn't been coming much.

31:31.560 --> 31:32.880
These days,

31:32.960 --> 31:35.600
she's been in the Graceful Palace
by herself, working on things.

31:35.680 --> 31:36.960
Who knows what she's up to.

31:38.080 --> 31:39.720
She's also visited
Princess Qingyang a few times,

31:40.680 --> 31:41.520
but they didn't argue.

31:42.280 --> 31:43.440
She seems to be doing okay.

31:44.680 --> 31:45.520
But it's hard to say

31:46.240 --> 31:47.800
whether she's really fine

31:47.880 --> 31:49.120
or just pretending to be.

31:54.680 --> 31:57.360
EVERJOY PALACE

32:23.160 --> 32:25.120
Breaking into the princess's room…

32:25.200 --> 32:26.600
What are your intentions?

32:28.880 --> 32:30.240
Why are you secretly sending letters?

32:32.880 --> 32:34.680
It's just a family letter to my mother.

32:35.280 --> 32:36.560
If it's a family letter,

32:37.080 --> 32:37.920
why wasn't it reported?

32:38.000 --> 32:39.960
If you don't believe me,

32:40.040 --> 32:41.680
you can open it and see for yourself.

32:46.560 --> 32:48.080
The Xilin King is coming to see you.

32:49.320 --> 32:51.000
Did you secretly send him a letter

32:51.520 --> 32:52.760
to make this happen?

32:56.360 --> 32:58.120
You know my relationship with him

32:58.200 --> 32:59.720
better than anyone else.

33:00.240 --> 33:02.320
He's the person I hate most

33:03.320 --> 33:04.800
in this entire world.

33:05.640 --> 33:06.880
I don't know.

33:08.920 --> 33:12.320
You've always been unreliable and cunning.

33:14.280 --> 33:15.120
Your words

33:16.360 --> 33:17.680
are not trustworthy.

33:21.040 --> 33:23.560
And you're a noble and upright person?

33:23.640 --> 33:25.520
Then why did you pretend
not to know me before?

33:26.040 --> 33:27.480
What were you hiding?

33:28.760 --> 33:29.920
I wasn't hiding anything.

33:31.720 --> 33:33.880
I simply refused to associate
with someone like you.

33:34.640 --> 33:35.760
Someone like me?

33:38.840 --> 33:40.720
The Saint Emperor you respect most

33:40.800 --> 33:43.000
is quite willing to associate

33:43.080 --> 33:44.080
with someone like me.

33:45.040 --> 33:46.200
It's just a temporary arrangement.

33:50.240 --> 33:52.920
That proves
the Saint Emperor is a wise man.

33:53.680 --> 33:54.800
A wise man

33:54.880 --> 33:56.880
sees the essence of things

33:57.800 --> 33:59.200
and knows what truly matters.

34:00.720 --> 34:02.480
But you'll never learn

34:03.760 --> 34:05.200
how to let go of the past

34:05.280 --> 34:06.280
and move forward.

34:07.560 --> 34:10.120
And you can so easily let go of the past?

34:11.679 --> 34:12.679
Of course…

34:13.679 --> 34:15.679
Your past is full of schemes and lies.

34:16.560 --> 34:18.280
Naturally, there's nothing
worth remembering.

34:19.199 --> 34:20.600
Let me warn you.

34:21.719 --> 34:22.880
This is not Xilin.

34:24.719 --> 34:26.199
Don't even think
about playing tricks here.

34:35.280 --> 34:36.360
Who's there?

34:40.159 --> 34:42.679
I'm here to deliver
something for the maids.

35:04.560 --> 35:06.800
You lied to me! You said
you had no history with Qingyang.

35:06.880 --> 35:09.240
Now, I've caught you red-handed.
Have you also been lying to me

35:09.320 --> 35:10.440
about Zhao Ming?

35:11.600 --> 35:12.680
Handle this.

35:13.600 --> 35:15.440
Fine. Just come clean!

35:16.480 --> 35:17.680
You can't run now.

35:17.760 --> 35:18.840
There's no need for this.

35:18.920 --> 35:19.960
I'm not running.

35:20.480 --> 35:22.200
I know you have many questions.

35:22.280 --> 35:23.800
Let's take them one at a time.

35:23.880 --> 35:24.800
I promise to tell you everything.

35:25.480 --> 35:27.120
Then go ahead, speak up!

35:27.200 --> 35:29.360
What's the deal between Yan and Qingyang?

35:30.800 --> 35:32.680
Their story is not for me to tell.

35:33.280 --> 35:34.240
If you don't tell me,

35:34.800 --> 35:36.120
-I'll go ask Zhao Ming myself.
-No!

35:36.200 --> 35:38.280
His Majesty is very busy.
Don't bother him.

35:42.960 --> 35:43.960
Yan isn't from Dongze.

35:44.680 --> 35:45.800
You know it, right?

35:46.600 --> 35:49.080
I've heard Yan's home is in Xilin.

35:50.640 --> 35:52.840
If that could even be called a home,

35:52.920 --> 35:54.600
then his journey
wouldn't have been so hard.

35:55.920 --> 35:57.320
Yan had a tough life.

35:58.080 --> 35:59.520
When he was very young,

35:59.600 --> 36:01.960
his parents sold him to the shadow guard
corps of the Xilin palace.

36:02.560 --> 36:04.360
Such a small child

36:04.440 --> 36:05.720
suffered horrific torment.

36:05.800 --> 36:07.280
He fought tooth and nail

36:07.360 --> 36:09.400
just to survive
in such a brutal environment.

36:10.120 --> 36:12.800
From then on,
he was confined to the shadows,

36:12.880 --> 36:14.600
taking on the most dangerous
murder missions.

36:22.000 --> 36:23.640
When Yan was at death's door,

36:24.240 --> 36:25.680
Princess Qingyang saved him.

36:28.920 --> 36:29.960
Who?

36:31.400 --> 36:32.640
A shadow guard from Xilin

36:32.720 --> 36:34.720
is planning to kill the Xilin princess?

36:40.000 --> 36:41.160
Your wound is poisoned.

36:41.760 --> 36:43.280
I bet you won't make it
out of this courtyard alive.

36:44.520 --> 36:45.480
This is poison.

36:46.600 --> 36:47.960
All I have here is poison.

36:48.040 --> 36:49.400
To fight poison with poison,

36:49.920 --> 36:52.080
if you're afraid, then forget it!

36:57.520 --> 36:59.720
To entrust your life
to a complete stranger

36:59.800 --> 37:01.240
you've only just met…

37:01.760 --> 37:03.000
It seems

37:03.080 --> 37:05.120
you don't care much about living, do you?

37:06.240 --> 37:07.800
Qingyang's mother
came from a humble background

37:08.480 --> 37:10.000
and was not favored by the Xilin King.

37:10.920 --> 37:13.920
Even though Qingyang was a princess,
her life was tough,

37:14.560 --> 37:16.440
living alone in the remotest corner.

37:17.600 --> 37:19.000
But because of this,

37:19.080 --> 37:21.840
Yan could sneak in and out
without being discovered.

37:24.200 --> 37:26.120
Your Highness,
this is the latest medicine.

37:26.200 --> 37:27.600
The King asks you to try it.

37:30.600 --> 37:32.600
The Xilin King sought immortality

37:32.680 --> 37:34.160
but feared the risks.

37:34.240 --> 37:35.160
He needed his blood relatives
for testing his medicines.

37:36.720 --> 37:39.640
So, the least favored Qingyang
became his subject.

37:43.080 --> 37:45.120
-What's wrong?
-Yan!

37:46.360 --> 37:47.200
You're here…

37:48.240 --> 37:49.440
What's wrong with your eyes?

37:50.440 --> 37:51.480
It's nothing.

37:51.560 --> 37:52.760
I've tried some medicines.

37:52.840 --> 37:55.040
I'll be fine soon. Don't worry.

37:55.560 --> 37:58.240
Yan was furious, but he had no choice.

37:58.320 --> 38:00.200
He often stayed by Qingyang's side,

38:00.280 --> 38:02.040
stealing medicine for her
from the royal clinic

38:02.640 --> 38:03.720
and secretly punishing those
who bullied her.

38:04.960 --> 38:08.360
Thus, these two unfortunate souls
began to rely on each other.

38:09.040 --> 38:10.920
They developed feelings for one another,

38:11.000 --> 38:12.560
but neither said a word.

38:13.680 --> 38:15.160
Because simply surviving

38:15.920 --> 38:16.880
was already a luxury

38:17.880 --> 38:18.960
for both of them.

38:21.160 --> 38:22.200
And then?

38:23.640 --> 38:24.760
Then,

38:25.880 --> 38:29.800
the Xilin King somehow learned
of Yan's feelings for Qingyang.

38:29.880 --> 38:31.800
He told Yan he could join the army.

38:32.480 --> 38:34.200
The border wars were intense.

38:34.280 --> 38:36.040
If he earned military merit
and rose to the rank of general,

38:36.640 --> 38:38.480
marrying the princess
wouldn't be impossible.

38:39.080 --> 38:41.520
-So, Yan left?
-Yes, he left.

38:41.600 --> 38:42.560
Through the flames of war

38:42.640 --> 38:43.600
and sleepless nights on the battlefield,

38:43.680 --> 38:44.760
he survived countless brushes with death.

38:45.680 --> 38:46.760
Years later,

38:46.840 --> 38:50.120
bearing scars and military merits,
Yan returned victorious.

38:50.200 --> 38:51.480
But he learned

38:51.560 --> 38:54.160
that the Xilin King had betrothed Qingyang

38:54.240 --> 38:56.720
to an old merchant
in pursuit of gold mines for alchemy.

38:58.800 --> 39:01.040
Confronting the Xilin King, Yan was told

39:01.640 --> 39:03.440
that if he could retrieve
the treasure from Nanyuan,

39:03.520 --> 39:04.960
he could marry the princess.

39:05.840 --> 39:08.840
Thus, Yan ventured alone to Nanyuan,

39:09.760 --> 39:10.920
risking his life repeatedly.

39:11.640 --> 39:14.120
In the end,
he brought the treasure back to Xilin.

39:14.760 --> 39:16.240
But when he presented it,

39:16.320 --> 39:17.840
he discovered
the treasure chest was empty.

39:19.280 --> 39:21.640
No one knew how the treasure
had gone missing.

39:22.280 --> 39:24.520
Yan begged the Xilin King
to give him another chance.

39:25.160 --> 39:26.560
The Xilin King agreed

39:26.640 --> 39:27.720
that if Yan could gather

39:27.800 --> 39:29.360
100,000 liang of gold
as a bride price within six months,

39:29.440 --> 39:31.440
-Get lost!
-he would grant the marriage.

39:33.160 --> 39:34.520
But before he left,

39:35.040 --> 39:37.680
Yan overheard Qingyang
discussing with the Xilin King.

39:37.760 --> 39:38.800
Father,

39:38.880 --> 39:42.000
when Yan brings back
the 100,000 liang of gold,

39:42.080 --> 39:43.960
I'll secretly hide one piece.

39:44.040 --> 39:46.680
When he fails to meet the target,

39:46.760 --> 39:48.840
we can propose another condition.

39:48.920 --> 39:51.360
You are truly my good daughter.

39:54.080 --> 39:56.080
It turned out everything
had been Qingyang's plan.

39:56.880 --> 39:58.960
She saved Yan during his time of crisis

39:59.560 --> 40:01.280
to gain a most loyal servant.

40:02.160 --> 40:05.000
Then, she used Yan's affection

40:05.080 --> 40:06.640
to complete the Xilin King's tasks,

40:06.720 --> 40:08.600
making her own life better.

40:11.080 --> 40:12.160
Do you believe it?

40:14.000 --> 40:15.160
Yan didn't believe it either.

40:16.120 --> 40:18.440
So, he asked Qingyang directly.

40:19.920 --> 40:22.080
Since you've already heard,

40:22.160 --> 40:23.560
there's nothing left for me to hide.

40:24.280 --> 40:26.400
Did you really think
I wanted to marry you?

40:27.120 --> 40:29.240
Although we've both suffered greatly,

40:29.320 --> 40:31.600
that doesn't mean you and I
are the same kind of people.

40:32.640 --> 40:34.600
After all, I'm a princess of Xilin,

40:34.680 --> 40:36.840
while you are merely a shadow guard.

40:36.920 --> 40:38.280
Even if I used you,

40:38.360 --> 40:40.240
you should be grateful.

40:40.320 --> 40:43.000
At least you still have
some value to be used. Agree?

40:49.200 --> 40:51.240
Consumed by sorrow
and anger, Yan left Xilin,

40:51.320 --> 40:52.600
wandering across various nations.

40:53.240 --> 40:54.720
He was fortunate to be recognized
by the Saint Emperor

40:54.800 --> 40:56.160
and found his place in Dongze.

41:00.320 --> 41:02.320
So, Yan's past

41:02.400 --> 41:03.560
was truly so bitter.

41:05.920 --> 41:06.760
But Hezhou,

41:08.320 --> 41:09.600
why do I feel

41:10.120 --> 41:11.920
that Qingyang isn't that kind of person?

41:12.000 --> 41:13.640
How long have you known Qingyang?

41:14.160 --> 41:15.600
Yan knows better

41:15.680 --> 41:16.560
what kind of person Qingyang is.

41:17.280 --> 41:19.880
Just listen to Yan's advice
and stay away from Qingyang.

41:22.960 --> 41:25.480
Does Zhao Ming know about this past?

41:27.120 --> 41:28.240
He knows.

41:29.800 --> 41:31.160
Then why does he

41:31.760 --> 41:32.840
still want to marry Qingyang?

41:35.840 --> 41:37.920
His Majesty can't simply act
as he pleases.

41:39.560 --> 41:40.600
He has his own considerations.

41:41.960 --> 41:43.520
What has Zhao Ming been busy with lately?

41:44.400 --> 41:45.640
Why doesn't he want to see me?

41:47.200 --> 41:48.040
It's complex.

41:48.960 --> 41:50.120
In short,

41:50.960 --> 41:52.680
he's busy refining methods
to resist the deities.

41:53.680 --> 41:54.880
He has no time to spare.

42:00.280 --> 42:01.560
Qingyang

42:02.080 --> 42:04.640
can help Zhao Ming, can't she?

42:22.960 --> 42:25.520
Your Majesty, Miss Pearl has gone
to Princess Qingyang's palace

42:25.600 --> 42:26.680
and hasn't returned yet.

42:29.280 --> 42:36.280
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

42:44.440 --> 42:45.800
For Princess Qingyang's birthday,

42:45.880 --> 42:47.640
His Majesty has arranged
a banquet in her honor.

42:47.720 --> 42:49.440
The Xilin King has also come in person.

42:49.520 --> 42:51.160
-She's truly blessed!
-Place it over there.

42:51.240 --> 42:52.920
-Let's go.
-She's a princess, after all.

42:53.000 --> 42:54.960
That's not something we could ever envy.

42:55.040 --> 42:55.960
All right.

42:58.320 --> 42:59.840
Why haven't you acted yet?

43:00.520 --> 43:01.440
Don't tell me

43:02.400 --> 43:04.240
you're waiting here

43:04.320 --> 43:05.880
to see your mother sacrificed.

43:06.520 --> 43:08.480
If anything happens to my mother,

43:08.560 --> 43:09.480
don't think you'll get away
with it either!

43:13.360 --> 43:15.600
Is that how you talk to your father?

43:20.440 --> 43:21.480
Don't you want the antidote anymore?

43:22.640 --> 43:23.840
I've told you,

43:24.680 --> 43:26.720
murdering Zhao Ming isn't easy.

43:26.800 --> 43:27.680
I need time.

43:29.280 --> 43:30.280
This Soul Scattering Poison

43:30.360 --> 43:33.080
was specially made
for Zhao Ming by the divine envoy.

43:33.160 --> 43:34.920
Apply it to a sharp weapon,

43:35.000 --> 43:37.320
and when the right moment comes,
pierce it into his body.

43:37.400 --> 43:39.160
Even with his inborn divine channels,

43:39.760 --> 43:41.000
he won't be able to withstand it.

43:45.320 --> 43:46.560
Your mother

43:47.360 --> 43:48.600
is all alone in Xilin.

43:49.320 --> 43:52.280
She misses you day and night.

43:53.320 --> 43:54.960
The sooner you complete the mission,

43:55.040 --> 43:56.160
the sooner you can return to Xilin

43:56.240 --> 43:57.640
and unite with your mother.
